&_nc_oc=AdoQrcStcBfNpjNc03-L6Z-VokViydpMiSpoeDtT8sPqsA8ltrYfXfmDEEs5rjvZLV0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af0tqiINcxl1XYpj358J5Syj0aKiynFnpTzOGAM3NylbZw&oe=69F8B83E"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=okAx8ytHAiMQ7kNvwGBRY-E&_nc_oc=AdqcFh9WvEBxPMOYGH_sS-lUC7NdB7WIBXgO4YBrY48m0PSR8pF5_vUoj1E2u4Ej9eY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af2zyvEzBYXbre4XfmuSRB7NCCfDf6-dv4ywyCTjrWS2mQ&oe=69F890FC"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Jj9-Bs2U0R4Q7kNvwH2XXe2&_nc_oc=AdqbM8gEMOtWnwVNn3obEDHsZ3gE6AVTIXMxKELdpvW5uV-0H9q5uAGNtUTytmDelL4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af1VmGFfbDYoKNeRV11e5cm8ukC9ckve3BIfQbu5aUZpCw&oe=69F8AF87"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2jw6njli9J8Q7kNvwGD4lmy&_nc_oc=Adr0NDSjnBA0lmVrcxZBois9utWTnm1ECCQ4YIBL2U6fn0IZrTHD0lVVmVDYXTiCeUI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af1AXZ9zbrbCkNp0I7F5lNCf4ZJCDeYSNR9QjGUAJ4etQQ&oe=69F89B55"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DtIwCnZ1JhwQ7kNvwH9yB_r&_nc_oc=AdrYcago9tGp2PMX02Oh72T_GHaX9AH9-Tngvo4u2ezBkxkAvEkJz33-vafG-jFO-bA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af11CM0pqZ3S5XyUIp45jnOnQZx5iv0sFRCv3XrejDJ_bQ&oe=69F8A7E4"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.